sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-gorzelak-crinoid-stereom-gyroid> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-gorzelak-crinoid-stereom-gyroid-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-gorzelak-crinoid-stereom-gyroid-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Yang et al. (2022) & Donnay & Pawson (1969) biogenic single-crystal calcite TPMS echinoderm stereom (Diamond D, Gyroid G, Primitive P) & Gibson-Ashby cellular mechanics — MorphoEval overall 48.5/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 1 (v1) baseline evaluation of `2020-gorzelak-crinoid-stereom-gyroid.py` (consensus score 52.4/100). The v1 script evaluates only a 2D slice of the Schoen Gyroid level set and a 1D Gibson–Ashby stiffness curve, omitting 3D voxel and implicit-surface mean/Gaussian curvature computation across Schwarz Diamond (D), Schoen Gyroid (G), Schwarz Primitive (P), and disordered Cahn–Hilliard spinodal stereom, omitting level-set threshold c in [-0.8, 0.8] solid fraction & Euler characteristic chi topological analysis, omitting [111] vs [100] crystallographic projection bands and edge dislocations, omitting 12-species cross-taxa Echinodermata validation, and failing to load or segment the vendored crinoid ossicle stereom SEM specimen image. Overall 48.5/100 (faithfulness 41.0, reproducibility 65.9); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit HEAD; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 54, Morphological realism / specimen match 24, Parameter expressivity 44, Morphometric validation 50, Source and data traceability 64, Code-to-model traceability 62, Reproducibility package 70. Output judged: docs/media/crinoid_stereom_gyroid_comparison.png: rendered output of 2020-gorzelak-crinoid-stereom-gyroid.py at HEAD, image/png, 95576 B, 1365×572 px, artifact_sha256 15af9af33e400cd89194f5f2adc889844144643f661ebe5efb7e2dc8266184db (sha256 15af9af33e400cd89194f5f2adc889844144643f661ebe5efb7e2dc8266184db), spec_fingerprint 7546780a29581d038c82edc49698f8e73b11c59c0a49d82e3dfc8f721733c9d2. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 7546780a29581d038c82edc49698f8e73b11c59c0a49d82e3dfc8f721733c9d2; artifact_sha256: 15af9af33e400cd89194f5f2adc889844144643f661ebe5efb7e2dc8266184db; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/crinoid_stereom_gyroid/crinoid_stereom_gyroid_reference.json=c1c3848ef15d0bfc..., datasets/crinoid_stereom_gyroid/crinoid_stereom_ossicle_specimen.jpg=5fbf6e4db0ee1d44..., datasets/crinoid_stereom_gyroid/scout_manifest.json=0524b76e141ef1fe...}." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Compute 3D implicit-surface mean curvature H and Gaussian curvature K = kappa_1*kappa_2 <= 0 on the zero level set, sweep level-set threshold c in [-0.8, 0.8] to verify odd inversion symmetry phi(0) = 0.5000 and topological genus / Euler characteristic chi = -4, model crystallographic [111] vs [100] projection bands and edge dislocations, and validate Gibson–Ashby stretching (phi^1) vs bending (phi^2) stiffness across all 12 Echinodermata species in `crinoid_stereom_gyroid_reference.json`.",
            "remediation needed: Expose full CLI parameter overrides (`--a0`, `--c-thresh`, `--e-calcite`, `--n-grid`, `--seed`, `--skip-gif`), upgrade `self_test()` to an 8-point verification suite with bitwise two-run determinism, and render a 6-panel publication-grade synthesis figure and co-evolving 2-panel 3D TPMS level-set & curvature GIF.",
            "remediation needed: Implement full 3D voxel and implicit-surface differential geometry (`evaluate_tpms_3d_unit_cell`) across all 5 stereom regimes: (1) Schwarz Diamond D (Z=4 tetrahedral nodes at 109.4712 deg), (2) Schoen Gyroid G (Z=3 chiral trigonal nodes at 120 deg), (3) Schwarz Primitive P (Z=6 orthogonal cubic nodes at 90 deg), (4) stochastic Cahn–Hilliard spinodal labyrinthic stereom control, and (5) super-threshold pinch-off ablation control (c = 1.35 -> loss of bicontinuity).",
            "remediation needed: Load and SHA-256-verify `datasets/crinoid_stereom_gyroid/` at runtime and perform Difference-of-Gaussians pore and trabecular lattice segmentation (`segment_crinoid_stereom_specimen`) on `crinoid_stereom_ossicle_specimen.jpg`, measuring Panel K solid fraction (0.5187 vs 0.5000), nearest-neighbor pore distance (14.25 px), and trabecular lattice period a_0 (14.80 um = 19.67 px)." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.485"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (Pass 1 baseline assessor)" ;
        dct:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .
}

